kstars for Debian

Upstream distribution is now splitted in 2 packages for binaries and arch-indep.
Starting from version 3.7.8, KStars documentation is fully removed from sources. As a result, kstars-doc package is not available anymore.

To reach the complete KStars Handbook, available in different languages, please visit:

    https://kstars-docs.kde.org

